{"server":"cn","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_01_beg","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_01","title":"赴大荒","storyCode":"HS-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3e7a1d98aeb06af356575eaf7bba92241672a2508a36ca79611f548f129c3a38","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g7_fieldhouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"三个月前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊奇的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？！手上这条断了的是人纹不是地纹，意思是我不会有什么大病大灾，其实是脑子出了问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快乐的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，都说了那棵核桃树就是给你种的，赶快去施肥吧，迟了可不好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是这么说，这道断纹只是代表着你大概在二十出头的年纪，会遇到一个很困难的抉择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是哪有十全十美的出路呢，顺其自然吧。你看，之后的纹路不就平整多了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊奇的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准！真准！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊奇的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我二十三岁的时候，老家的农田被天灾毁了，当时我实在不知道去移动城市能讨到什么生计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊奇的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在跟着大伙来到大荒城研究庄稼，干回老本行了，不也活得挺好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快乐的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这种事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有人真的能预测命数呢，不过是给发生的事找个理由罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊奇的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前只知道天师府的天师神通广大，没想到还懂得这么多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊奇的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍姑娘，您这么年轻就已经是这里天师府的资深授业天师了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闻道有先后，只是先学到了一些知识，再把它转述给更多人罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快乐的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了不起，了不起，不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"快乐的职农","speakerId":"avg_npc_1250_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍姑娘，我看那边有个年轻小伙子盯着你看半天了......是你的熟人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是位贵客。抱歉，我们改天再聊吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大炎司岁台秉烛人，左乐，奉命前来监管大荒城建设以及岁兽相关事务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会限制黍小姐的日常活动，但希望黍小姐近日不要离开大荒城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还请黍小姐配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，之前听说要新来一位秉烛人，原来就是你呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是司岁台例行的检查，并不会妨碍黍小姐的农业研究，黍小姐只要专心原本的事务，不必担——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么看上去这么年轻，今年成年了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这儿地方偏远，来的路上还顺利吗？有没有遇到歹徒刁难？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不至于被几个剪径贼难为住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，关于此处十二楼五城的修建，司岁台支持各位与炎国工部共同施行、合作共赢，希望各位能够与诸位天师友好相处，少生事端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除此之外，还有一些事情需要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，平时活动的话，这里田间可以随便走，小心别踩到庄稼就行，但要是去工厂那边恐怕还是要提前和天师他们打招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黍小姐......工作范围，我还是清楚的。我还有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一个秉烛人在这里住过的屋子是那一间，平时生活用的物件已经换过新的，你可以直接用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，就是这些了，你还有什么问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没......没有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，田间要忙的事还有不少，我就不多招呼你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是还遇到什么困难，开口和周围乡亲打招呼就行，这里的人都好客，不会让你为难的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g7_fieldhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，这位姑娘，我有公务——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饭盒？这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"饿了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这一动不动站了一整天，看上去呆呆的，都不知道自己找饭吃，像个稻草人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多......多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常可口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽皮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，你就准备白吃吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小满，这位是客人，不能这么没礼貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这不是黍姐姐说的嘛？住在大荒城的每一个人，都是和庄稼打了交道，流了汗才能吃饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人奇奇怪怪，说是有公务，但是不种田也不去造房子，不知道来干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位先生，有他自己的工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这干瞪眼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这干瞪眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知有什么......我能帮得上忙的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"插秧机，你会操作吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，你平时的工作应该也不会和这些农具打交道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个小方块，叫六相仪，只要用这个控制天桩插到田里对应的位置，就能分区块监测农田情况——你会用吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没有了解过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那给牧兽喂草料......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你要在这里留一段时间的话，不如就趁这段时间试着做些农活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如，先学着把试验田里那些没处理的野草都锄干净吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农业天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师您在吗，我这里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾，来得正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我在京城的远房表弟，这段时间在大荒城休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黍","speakerId":"avg_2025_shu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位就是我的学生禾生，他可以来教你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"定位器显示牧兽就在这一片吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！我吹这个羽兽笛，绵绵就知道我在找他，就会出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"定位器是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城每头牧兽身上都会有，虽然不能精准定位，但能看到大概位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城上万头牧兽，每头都有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前发生过不少牧兽走丢的事情，师兄们养的课题经常被外面的异性吸引走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，确实没怎么接触过这些东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然是老师的远房亲戚，为什么会去当兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不足为外人道也。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家里当官的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么这么问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讲话的方式。还有那股精气神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这儿的同龄人很少有这样的，有也是高干子弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无意冒犯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也没说你冒犯到谁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，为什么不出来呢......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绵绵前几天和小辫儿吵架了，难道是因为这个他才走的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道又是被外面的母兽吸引走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他是喜欢小辫儿的！每天我带他们去泥塘里滚泥，他们两个都要在一块的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不行，小烛台！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小、小烛台......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你画下他的样子，你看一看记下来，我们分头去找！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......小满姑娘笔力深厚，令人一目了然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你认真的？我知道绵绵都认不出，你能认得出？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是四条腿，身上长花斑，哪里看不出？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小烛台，你在外面见过牧兽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很少见到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，你没见过牧兽，我也没见过移动城市，大家都有没见过的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从来没去过外面——其他的城市吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没去过，但听小禾说过不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里种的稻谷每年都会送往外面，他们还在研究新种子，就是要让外面的人都吃饱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后有的是机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不着急，我本来就更喜欢这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！正好，你闻——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......酒香？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最喜欢吃稻米甜酒酿！你看那边有蒸汽的地方就是酿酒的厂子，咱们待会儿可以顺路去那里看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来这里还有酒厂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每季收获，我们都会专门留一些稻谷酿酒，最陈的那一坛好像已经有了百多年的历史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你喝过酒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经喝过一点......是执行任务时遇到的老乡给的玉米叶子酒。又辣又呛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他让我们喝了暖暖身子，但我们没想到是这种酒。他说饭都不够吃，哪还有多余的粮食做酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在外面，还是会有人吃不饱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片土地太宽广了......不同地方，差异很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听到了......是在那边吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，小烛台，你飞得好高......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定能很快找到绵绵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们的无人机能飞得更高，还有定位功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"犯不着这么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么在着火？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g6_civilengineermasteroffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三个月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三个月。这项工程不是儿戏，我们需要时间来确保每一个环节都不出问题，三个月能做完就已经是谢天谢地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“十二楼五城”，这几个字可不是简单的诗歌摘抄。你知道这些......“原型”在大炎历代天师心里躺了多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自然。我也知道，万事开头难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下虽然是行政官员，但好歹也是天师府的学生。源石技艺当然不如各位精湛，但不是每天只坐在桌子后面盯着自己的天师仪喝茶水的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三个月，当年大雪纷飞的炎北地区，我们也花了三个月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸位天师好好考虑过再给我一个回复。大荒城核心区最后两个地块的组装工作，还要多少时间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深土木天师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能源物资补给充足的话，大概一月出头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石能源的事不用担心，补给的物资我已经反复督促了。各位天师只管赶上工程进度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天高地远，且不说建城，物资的运输都是一项大工程，我们这里多耽搁一天，耗费的资源财力都是大数字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是为了体恤年年纳税的百姓，也容不得我们懈怠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在是六月，希望中秋节时，各位都已经回到家中和亲人团聚了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里都逃不掉遍地羽毛的事，宁小姐见笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“三个月”“炎北地区”，说的是那年的丹燕城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大雪封城，朝廷已经决定要停工等待，可等信使到了那儿，却发现领头的天师以一座地块为刀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......撞开了冰封的源石晶层，救下了数万被困在严冬里的村镇百姓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段故事如今都被写进了教科书里，万侍郎事后也因此平步青云，刚才的说辞还真是谦虚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，您误会了。我也不过是个从底层一步一步爬上来的土木天师，哪敢摆什么架子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工部侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是唯有提起这茬，这些辛劳的天师才愿意放下怨气，听我多说几句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来万侍郎有十足把握，十二楼五城的进度不会有什么问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，就算我有信心，各项事宜，还是有点太仓促了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是再小心，也难免有疏漏，到时候还要麻烦宁侍郎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分内之职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......宁小姐初到大荒城不久，对这里环境还不太熟悉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然地处边境，比不上内地繁华，但物产丰富，尤其是作物做出的各色小吃，又风趣，又落胃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，我想想，宁小姐吃过城内的“五豆粥”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，还没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城的五豆粥与其他地方不大一样，算是特色了。多用新品种的五豆，即红豆、黑豆、绿豆、黄豆和白芸豆熬煮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，虽然五豆相得益彰，但大荒城的五豆粥之所以是一绝，还是靠着这里独一无二的......稻米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城稻米香甜，风味浓郁，才能成为这一碗佳肴的基底，才能让平平无奇的五豆粥成为大荒城饮食文化的象征。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看似五豆一米，各成滋味，但说到底，成在稻米。所以烹饪起来，也不是一锅乱煮就了事了，有些讲究的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诀窍在于火候。不能让其余五豆喧宾夺主，要是失去了稻香底色，那这碗粥，就变回无味寡淡平平无奇的杂粮粥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐有空，一定得尝尝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，宁尚书最近身体还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖父年纪大了，没病是福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人家，还是要保重身体。不如下次回百灶述职时，为老尚书带些薄礼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万侍郎有这份心意就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然大荒城与岁兽有关，那我也少不了和司岁台、礼部打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我过去就对宁尚书过往的壮举钦佩不已，可惜岁月不饶人......时至今日，宁尚书还是少操劳些具体事的好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有人觉得我出现在大荒城属于多管闲事，我可以立刻去信一封，递交太傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您又误会了，我只是想说，宁小姐年纪轻轻就能胜任侍郎一职，是宁家的幸事，是宁尚书教导有方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万侍郎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"万侍郎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1241_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是您只是想说，“毫无实绩的宁辞秋不配和丹燕城的传奇天师共事”，那我不否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是你我同事一场，以后，还希望您打开天窗说亮话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要弯弯绕绕自以为聪明。真聪明的人，比你讨喜得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告辞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农业天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，水桶，水桶！还好火刚烧起来，还是在河边......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么会在林子边上生火？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烧山可是重罪！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农业天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有要烧山！是师姐！她的课题是只羽兽，那羽兽吃了我的课题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农业天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只给我的课题那片地上留下了一颗蛋，我要烤了这颗蛋......泄愤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农业天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是泄愤，我只是要烤了这颗蛋纪念我逝去的课题！呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别废话了！快快快，火要烧到后面去了！快把火苗踩灭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农业天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你锄头，趁风不大，快清出隔离带来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去清开后面的植物，不能让火烧到后面去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g8_crestofweir"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"农业天师学徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_1247_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"走丢的牧兽","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？......绵绵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绵绵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我终于找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么跑到这里来了？......你先偷偷告诉我，你到底喜不喜欢小辫儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以左乐那小子去哪了，说去清开后面的植物，人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会是小烛台他......迷路了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绵绵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我们再去找找他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绵绵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1244_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这。我刚刚去那边，没找到绵......呃，绵绵，但是在一个草窝里发现了这俩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两只还未睁眼的牧兽幼崽被左乐用外衣裹紧，抱在怀中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这样小的幼兽，你不该把它们带回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我仔细查看了四周，母兽不在附近，放它们在那里肯定会丧命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"带回来接受你们的统一管理，不是更好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是“管理”，我们都是朋友！是互帮互助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们能给我们带来绒毛，我们为他们提供好吃的草料，顺便也帮着驱赶一下蚊虫，挠挠痒痒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"野生的幼崽带回大荒城，不确定是否有传染病，也不确定它们能不能接受饲养，而且......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他都已经抱在怀里了，沾上了味道，就算还回去母兽也不会要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才说他不应该把它们带回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但带回来了肯定要处理呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小满，明明是他什么都不懂，有错在先，你为什么总是在为他说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，就是因为他什么都不懂，还做错了事，是个笨蛋，我才这样的呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我回去问问老师们，看看要怎么处理两个小家伙。我们快点回去吧，别让他们着凉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！又是你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凶大叔，你今天午饭吃了吗？刚才这边着火了，你又不会说话，要不是我们你就被烧到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小满，别凑过去了，小心他的斧子真的砍到你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他才不会呢，只要我一吹笛子，他就安静下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他很喜欢我吹笛子，每次来都是这样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老樵夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1243_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看吧！你们都说这里不能来，但我经常偷偷跑来这里的，就是河对岸一直过不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凶大叔只要一听我吹这首歌就会安静，我见过他笑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还能像这样凑过去摸摸他的斧子，他总是紧紧地攥着，但其实他很......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小满","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么突然打我，我生气了，下次我不给你带吃的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——小满，别过去了，快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这两只幼崽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......带回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次做事前，先过过脑子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我来这里这么久......究竟都干了什么？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
